{"id":"be38aee184dd1b06","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-proof-predicate.md","title":"Proof Predicate","display":"df-proof-predicate — Proof Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-proof-predicate","aliases":["67-df-proof-predicate"],"display":"df-proof-predicate — Proof Predicate","depends_on":["[[67-df-proof-sequence]]","[[67-df-certified-proof]]"],"verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","source_proof_status":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-proof-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-proof-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof-predicate — Proof Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae771d715f89349c\" href=\"?note=ae771d715f89349c\" title=\"67-df-proof-sequence\">67-df-proof-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a></span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,n \\in \\mathbb{N}\">\\(p,n \\in \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (proof code and formula code)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProofSequence}_T(p,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProofSequence}_T(p,n)\\)</span> (coded proof-sequence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ae771d715f89349c\" href=\"?note=ae771d715f89349c\" title=\"67-df-proof-sequence\">67-df-proof-sequence</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_T\\)</span> (proof predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> 为上游证明序列所绑定的固定有效公理呈示；本谓词是外部自然数关系，内部表示公式记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_T\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_T(p,n) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ProofSequence}_T(p,n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Proof}_T(p,n) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ProofSequence}_T(p,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both arguments are natural-number codes; formulas themselves are encoded before entering this predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-proof-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"ae771d715f89349c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-proof-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-certified-proof","status":"resolved","id":"189f5355af0e487c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-certified-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-proof-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"ae771d715f89349c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProofSequence}_T(p,n)$ (coded proof-sequence predicate, see [[67-df-proof-sequence]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p,n \\in \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProofSequence}_T(p,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_T","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_T(p,n) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ProofSequence}_T(p,n)","display":true}],"bytes":1177,"backlinks":[{"id":"cd71da66769f105b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为有效一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 固定有效公理呈示及其证明码关系 $\\mathrm{Proof}_T$，见 [[67-df-proof-predicate]]。"},{"id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"另取带 [[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]] 的 $g=c_K$ 的有效签名 $K$、公理集 $E\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_K$ 和呈示 $E_E$，满足 [[67-df-certified-proof]] 的 $\\mathrm{Present}_K(E,E_E)$。$\\mathrm{Proof}_E(p,n)$ 取 [[67-df-proof-predicate]] 在同一 $K,g,E_E$ 下的外部证明码关系。"},{"id":"45046cfa53052599","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Proof}_T(p,n)$ 是 [[67-df-proof-predicate]] 的外部证明码关系；$n,k,p,q\\in\\mathbb N$。"},{"id":"6a4c234306a0ec0c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7cb4b381ccf9d5bd","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T+\\alpha=T\\cup\\{\\alpha\\}$ 使用同一演算及自然证明编号；$\\mathrm{Proof}$ 与 $\\ell_T$ 见 [[67-df-proof-predicate]]、[[67-df-proof-length]]，$\\mathrm{Rec}_1$ 见 [[67-df-recursive-function-class]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-proof-predicate]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-proof-predicate]]"}],"outgoing":["ae771d715f89349c","189f5355af0e487c"]}